  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "寫毛筆字"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>作者：</b></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>徐慧娟</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Hit日，陪阮後生kah查某囝leh練字，準備beh參加全國美展澎湖縣初賽。看兩个囡仔leh寫毛筆字，我心肝tiuh--一-下，時間ná像飛tńg去細漢時阿爸教我寫毛筆字ê時tsūn。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">我是厝內ê ban查某囝，細漢大家族蹛做伙ê時，tiānn-tiānn聽阿公講，阿母生我已經是第四个查某囝，阿爸kah阿母決定mài koh生--ah！後尾因為阮阿媽做一个夢，講夢著我正手抱一个查埔嬰仔，倒手koh牽一个細漢查埔囡仔，阿媽就叫阮阿母koh試看māi。後--來阿母真正生兩个小弟，逐家就講是我tshuā兩个小弟來，所以厝內逐家kā阮惜命命，阮就真靠勢，脾氣愈來愈大，個性愈來愈急性。阿爸感覺án-ne m̄好，就講beh教阮練字修養心性，阮感覺趣味趣味，就kā伊應好。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span></span></p><a name='more'></a><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tsit-má ê人練字lóng是買紙、買墨汁來用；早前逐家lóng真khioh-si̍p，練字lóng用報紙，準備墨盤kah墨，家己慢慢仔來磨墨汁。阿爸講，寫字進前磨墨汁是為著beh hōo心靜--落-來，先靜心tsiah練字，心bē靜字就ē浮。阿爸koh講磨墨ài仝一个方向，bē-sái siunn緊也bē-sái siunn慢，磨--出-來ê墨汁tsiah ē芳kah光，寫--出-來ê字tsiah ē suí。Suà--落-來，阿爸就uì永字八法開始慢慢仔教我寫字。逐擺練習煞洗毛筆，阿爸就教講洗毛筆ài沓沓仔來，免趕緊，洗hōo清氣，毛筆tsiah bē臭。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Kah阿爸學寫字ê日子，阿爸bē kā我講大道理，伊lóng叫我khuann-khuann仔是，免tio̍h急，後--來我就慣勢萬項代誌khuann-khuann仔來，漸漸仔確實有感覺自己ê個性有改變。有阿爸ê指導，tī國小kah國中我參加一寡比賽lóng有tio̍h獎。高中了後，因為準備聯考，就khah無時間寫毛筆字。大漢結婚生囝了後ná干樂，日--時ài食頭路，暗頭仔ài tshuân暗頓，ài顧囡仔寫功課，koh-khah無時間寫毛筆字。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">人講鳥仔教囝飛，魚仔教囝泅，我想阮阿爸想beh教--我--ê，m̄-nā學飛學泅án-ne niā-niā，iáu有伊對阮ê愛。我應該ài揣一工koh tńg去揣阿爸磨墨、寫毛筆字。&nbsp;</span></p></div><!--more--><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgpUHnSy7IYc2T1iotio0srqk2oWHfOTnRveXqLeBa6Dbv3C8S9wKwDPgcEfjyMWSK-cABe4x1NSikJ-K_sMu0K0W4eZhDX_Wx91gTVzplOaqqxvP7XeGA9J0kVeqnjHlLNbSClq2IS5OLj-QFZ4emmOCwDfO6SooFmPkY7GXaOYv0CCPwszPPYgXZo7_kl/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1364%E6%9C%9F_22.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgpUHnSy7IYc2T1iotio0srqk2oWHfOTnRveXqLeBa6Dbv3C8S9wKwDPgcEfjyMWSK-cABe4x1NSikJ-K_sMu0K0W4eZhDX_Wx91gTVzplOaqqxvP7XeGA9J0kVeqnjHlLNbSClq2IS5OLj-QFZ4emmOCwDfO6SooFmPkY7GXaOYv0CCPwszPPYgXZo7_kl/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1364%E6%9C%9F_22.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhsf1C8AxcViI33baYqYE9-duHiaJ4etMrxpIoh1SPcDPRmBRnFrMA4ZBDWHfA7Im9MR8yMjYayG2oLAwbIL-WOr_tKjYVJ-ezF1YbAGmcplqncQBh8fBzbVyWzCafMOiZKt9c-2j-nQP4f3wq610s86bmcPnWPvua8B8_dFHiPAKEx1_mftm8ObyHQO149/s1424/364%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhsf1C8AxcViI33baYqYE9-duHiaJ4etMrxpIoh1SPcDPRmBRnFrMA4ZBDWHfA7Im9MR8yMjYayG2oLAwbIL-WOr_tKjYVJ-ezF1YbAGmcplqncQBh8fBzbVyWzCafMOiZKt9c-2j-nQP4f3wq610s86bmcPnWPvua8B8_dFHiPAKEx1_mftm8ObyHQO149/w450-h640/364%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br